            // bundle the std stdout/stderr print backend. Its transitive
            // `ReentrantLock` internals carry a `NullPointerDereference` assert
            // outside the exact Div/Rem/BoundsCheck lane, which fails the whole
            // bundle and erases `main`'s OWN obligation rows. Left absent, its
